Ported files
------------
The files listed in docs/provenance/portable.tsv (first import) and
docs/provenance/portable-wave2.tsv (second import) were copied from the legacy
MindRoom Chat client (mindroom-ai/mindroom-chat-legacy, then named
mindroom-ai/mindroom-chat) at commit fc3a5905; git blame credited at
least 95% of each file's lines to Bas Nijholt. Per his instruction of
2026-11-02, he licenses the lines he wrote in those files under the Apache
License, Version 2.0 for this project. The grant covers only the lines he
wrote. Blame credits the committer, so some lines it gave him are third-party
material that he committed: the Capacitor templates and the Gradle wrapper
scripts, the T3 Code minimap port, the sign-in marks, the code block icons
and the context lines of the dependency patches. They keep the licenses that
their entries below give. Lines by any other author were blanked when copied
(docs/provenance/holes.tsv and holes-wave2.tsv) and written fresh here, as
were lines that matched the upstream client (docs/provenance/holes-overlap*.tsv).
Per his instruction of 2026-11-05, he also licenses the images of the third
import (docs/provenance/portable-wave3.tsv) that are his MindRoom artwork, and
the Android icons and splash screens that scripts/generate-android-icons.sh
draws from it, under the Apache License, Version 2.0 for this project. The
Capacitor template images of that import were replaced and are not covered.
docs/provenance/import.txt names the
import commits; docs/provenance.md describes the process.

